ai "Gunslinger"
about "Lets it fly. Trusts the arm over the read and will fit it into any window."
position QB
dials risk 0.85 patience 0.35 discipline 0.3 vision 0.6 aggression 0.8

rules:
  when before the throw and drop done and deep target open -> throw deep
  when before the throw and pressure -> throw to best
  when before the throw and time over 3s -> throw to best
  when with the ball and past the line -> cut upfield; lower shoulder
  otherwise -> follow assignment
